# PBGZ 的使用
## 1. 安装

```bash
git clone https://github.com/PBGZip/pbgz.git 
cd pbgz
./3rdparty/build.all.gcc.sh
build-release.sh
```

## 2. 使用

```bash
Usage: pbgz [OPTION] [FILE]

Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too.

  -d, --decompress  <file.nz> specify file to decompress
  -z, --gz          decompress to gz format
  -o, --outfile     <outfile> specify output filename for compress/decompress
  -O, --outdir      <outdir> specify output directory for compress/decompress
  -f, --force       force overwrite of output file. use for compress/decompress
  -r, --reference   <FASTA> specify reference gene file (it's not mandatory and only raw .fasta files are accepted, gzipped formats like .fasta.gz are not allowed) . use for compress/decompress
  -n, --refunpack   unpack reference to pbgz file, so reference gene is needed when decompress
  -t, --threads     <number> specify number of threads, default is CPUS. use for compress/decompress
  -l, --level       <1-3> specify compress level, default is 2, 1 is fast, 3 is best
  -e, --remove      if compress succeed, will remove origin file, else this option is invalid. use for compress
  -h, --help        give help info

To compress
  pbgz human.fq.gz -o /path/human.fq.gz.nz -r /path/ucsc.hg19.fa
To decompress
  pbgz -d human.fq.gz.nz
```

